 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DANGEROUS OBSTACLES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are full of obstacles and danger. You need to move quickly to escape the blizzard, but you must also watch where you step and plan your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443570/extras/acb1c4f62928fa949063c41fc078ce77.poster.avif?t=1754766192\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443570/extras/acb1c4f62928fa949063c41fc078ce77.webm?t=1754766192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443570/extras/acb1c4f62928fa949063c41fc078ce77.mp4?t=1754766192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u> PREPARE AND\u00a0PLAN AHEAD</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain enough time to start metamorphosis and reach the imago stage. The procedural levels grow more treacherous. Survey your path, plan ahead, and foster your bugs so you can survive the terrain and escape the blizzard. Time is precious. Spend it wisely.</p>",
